    "  - contracts/test/GoldenDigests.t.sol asserts the DEPLOYED CONTRACT",
    "    produces every value here.",
    "  - service/src/robinhood/auth/tests.rs asserts the RUST service's own",
    "    transcription produces every value here.",
    "  - service/src/robinhood/governance/tests.rs does the same for the",
    "    three GOVERNANCE vectors below.",
    "A drift on either side fails that side's test against a file it cannot",
    "quietly edit into agreement.",
    "",
    "Changing any input below changes every digest and invalidates the file.",
    "",
    "The governanceLimits values are TEST VECTORS, not policy. They are seven",
    "deliberately DISTINCT figures chosen so that reordering the Limits struct",
    "changes the payload hash. Production limits come from [robinhood.policy]",
    "and never from this file."
